W("Read: 'I think I know enough of hate / To say that for destruction ice / Is also great.' Explain why hate is compared to ice.", 3, "Hate is cold: it freezes warm feelings, makes people distant and hard-hearted, and destroys relationships as ice stops life. (3)", "M"),
