W("'The poem argues quietly rather than shouts.' Support this with two features of its language.", 4, "(i) Plain, conversational words such as 'some say' and 'I think'. (ii) Understatement: the end of the world is presented calmly, with phrases like 'would suffice'. The calm tone increases the shock of the idea. (4)", "H"),
