 ("p", "But he adds a twist. If the world had to be destroyed a second time ('perish twice'), he thinks he knows enough about hate to say that ice would be equally great as a means of destruction, and would be enough ('suffice'). Hate is cold; it freezes feeling and destroys life as surely as fire."),
